# ZERO TRUST VALIDATION CHECKLIST
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

When validating Zero Trust, check:

## Identity
- [ ] Strong authentication (MFA)
- [ ] Continuous validation
- [ ] Risk-based access decisions
- [ ] Identity governance

## Devices
- [ ] Device health verification
- [ ] Compliance checking
- [ ] Endpoint protection
- [ ] Device inventory

## Network
- [ ] Micro-segmentation
- [ ] Encrypted communications
- [ ] No implicit trust zones
- [ ] Network access control

## Applications
- [ ] Application-level authentication
- [ ] API security
- [ ] Input validation
- [ ] Secure coding practices

## Data
- [ ] Data classification
- [ ] Encryption (at rest and in transit)
- [ ] Data loss prevention
- [ ] Access logging

## Visibility
- [ ] Centralized logging
- [ ] Real-time monitoring
- [ ] Threat detection
- [ ] Incident response

